  "goodToKnow": "Umbenennen means to rename: eine Straße, eine Datei umbenennen. German history is full of renamings: Chemnitz was Karl-Marx-Stadt from 1953 to 1990, many GDR street names were changed after reunification, and today streets named after colonial figures are being renamed. Die Umbenennung is renaming. It's a mixed verb, separable: benannte um, umbenannt."
